+\begin{align}
+    \boxed{
+    \mathscr R_{\rm SST}
+    =
+    \frac{4\pi}{g_{\rm eff}^{\,2}}
+    =
+    \alpha_{\rm eff}^{-1}.
+    }
+    \label{eq:rt_alpha_em_stiffness_matching_v0835}
+\end{align}
+This is a \textbf{[BRIDGE / RESEARCH TARGET]}.  It is promoted only if the
